A||||5||Homicidal||This is PRECISELY why I didn't trust that mechanic!!||||6||
Z||000000||Homicidal||05-01-2000||05:24 PM||||I decided to catch him offgaurd by heading down when they open.  I get there and he is very surprised to see me.  I tell him, "I just wanted to take a look at those busted cylinders, so I can see what is wrong."<P>He reluctantly takes me back and shows me the engine.  The pushrod is missing out of the slave!  I ask him, "What is that?  Why is my pushrod gone?  You told me they were busted!"<P>He is silent for a second and then says, "Oh yes, I was just about to tell you, we found out your pushrod is too short and we can fix it, no charge!  It will be done in around 40 minutes!"<P>I smile, "Ok", I say, "But I don't have to be to work for a half hour, I'll stick around!"<P>So I do.  While waiting, I ask him why the car drove perfectly fine for 9 months with a pushrod that is "too short"?  He just keeps saying "Well, it shouldn't have."  Right....<P>So, I wait, and wait.  It's time for me to leave since it's been 45 mins already, and the car still isn't ready, of course.  So I tell him I'll wait more and I'll just call my work and tell them I'll be a bit late.  <P>He obviously hated that since he tells me right after, "Well, you really should get to work, you don't wanna make your boss mad!" <P>He wanted me out of there for some reason, which made me stay longer.  I wander back to the car and watch them install the new rod.  It works, it starts, I get my car and leave.  <BR>The car works great (except for the headlights now :mad <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and my cylinders are FINE.<P>SO......I am dying to call him up and ask him : Why he was going to charge $400 for installing new cylinders when all is wrong was the pushrod?<P>I know he was full of $hit, because he closed his shop at 5:00 the previous night and told me my cylinders were gone.  And I got there right at opening so they didn't have time to check it out.  <P>Anyways, it WAS my pressure plate and now my car is working again. <P>Hehe.....I am victorious!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
